{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45534","headline":"蜀中送人游庐山 · 隐峦","name":"蜀中送人游庐山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"居游正值芳春月，蜀道千山皆秀发。\n溪边十里五里花，云外三峯两峰雪。\n君上匡山我旧居，松萝抛掷十年余。\n君行试到山前问，山鸟只今相忆无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"隐峦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45534.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45534","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}